window.products.push({"id":1013096,"name":"REDASW Sherpa Fleece Blanket Queen Size Super Soft Fuzzy Thick Fuzzy Warm Soft Blankets Throw Velvet Double Reversible Blankets , Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O3RGm1dAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Soft & Warm: Both sides of the flannel top and Sherpa reverse are soft and warm, so it's a comfortable bed blanket for snuggling up when you have a sleep. If you want to be relaxed on your sofa/beds feeling warm on those freezing days and nights, there is no doubt that this Sherpa blanket is your best choice. Reversible with Decorative Line Design: The top side is flannel fleece (220gsm) and the bottom is Sherpa (260gsm), you can have two different senses of touch. This throw blanket is bound up with knit-trim edging for ornaments. Whether the rich smooth plush colored side or the beautiful and elegant white Sherpa side, this soft blanket will not disappoint you. Versatile Usage Scenarios: Snuggling On Your Couch And Bed With REDASW Plush And Warm Sherpa Fleece Blankets To Enjoy Your Family Happy Hours While Watching Favorite Tv Shows - Perfect For Indoor And Outdoor Use To Provide Consecutive Warmth In Chilly Weather, Especially For Camping And Picnic. Washing Instruction: Machine washable in gentle cycle, tumble dry on low heat. Do not use bleach. Made with shrink-resistant fabric. No matter how many times you wash, this cozy and plush warm Sherpa blanket is shrink resistant and not pilling. We advise that you wash it before the first using in order to remove the excessive lint left over during the manufacturing process. WORRY-FREE GUARANTEE:Customer satisfaction is our top priority always! Products are returnable and replaceable within 30-days for the premium quality of our cozy blanket. Not satisfied with the REDASW soft blanket? Feel free to contact us for your solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O3RGm1dAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REDASW","source_asin":"B09Y1C56JZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1013096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y1C56JZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y1C56JZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1013097,"name":"Home Pure Garden 6 Ft. Artificial Bamboo – Tall Faux Potted Indoor Floor Plant for Restaurant or Office Decor – Large and Lifelike (Green Trunk)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":101.41,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uBLKhPnHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring a natural touch to your indoor spaces year-round with the 6 Ft. Artificial Bamboo Plant. This faux bamboo tree is great for busy folks who want floor plants in their home or office, but don’t have time to care for living ones. The adjustable leaves and green stalks are vividly colored and have a natural look, reinvigorating your home, office or restaurant with décor that’s easy to care for. The artificial bamboo comes in its own 6.5-inch diameter pot, so it arrives ready to decorate your home. You can clean the leaves and stalks with a soft, damp cloth to keep them looking fresh and vibrant day after day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uBLKhPnHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pure Garden","source_asin":"B0BJLJZKLH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1013097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJLJZKLH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJLJZKLH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
