window.products.push({"id":1013099,"name":"Kichwit Plastic Liquor Pouches Drinking Flasks, Reusable Liquid Spout Bags, BPA Free, 3 32oz, 3 16oz, Collapsible Silicone Funnel Included, Transparen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yAJ1DGNqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There are reasons that you need these liquor pouches and they could be more useful than you think. Save Your Money Now! Guys, stop paying outrageous prices for alcohol on cruise ships, concerts and sports events! Being slimmer and more lightweight than bottled drinks or metal flasks, these flasks are easy to carry and perfect for taking along on trips for where booze is sparse or super expensive. Being transparent, they are easy to distinguish when being filled with different kinds of drinks. Undetectable by Scanners and Metal Detectors Finally, a flask that gets through metal detectors!They are made of nonmetallic material and undetectable by scanners and metal detectors. They could hold quite a fair amount of booze and are perfect for sneaking your liquor onto any trip inside your luggage. Odor Free, Leak Proof and Worry-Free Service These drinking flasks are made of high-density polyethylene (known as HDPE), which is odorless and BPA free. Being unbreakable and lightweight, they are great alternatives to glass bottles or metal flasks.Not happy with your purchase? Feel free to contact us any time via Amazon since we will always stand behind our product. Package Includes: 32oz plastic flask x3 16oz plastic flask x3 Silicone funnel x1 Warm Tips Before Use: Fill it with warm soapy water and rinse thoroughly. Blow some air to expand and leave upside down to dry.  Hand wash only.  Remove the plastic safety ring on each lid to ensure a complete seal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yAJ1DGNqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kichwit","source_asin":"B0B1TSKW9D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1013099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1TSKW9D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1TSKW9D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
