window.products.push({"id":1013243,"name":"Attiigny Autumn Gnomes Plush,Thanksgiving Day Home Decoration,Handmade Swedish Fall Harvest LED Gnomes, Scandinavian Dwarf Elf Dolls Tiered Tray Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KvmvlVLRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Good Symbols:The autumn gnomes are regarded as a symbol of good luck ,they can protect us from evil and misfortune .So they can also be given to your family and your friends as gifts . Excellent Home Decoration:The harvest gnomes can be put at your shelf, desk, table, sofa, bookcase or dining table, etc and it will add a fall festival atmosphere to your home decorations. Light Up Your Home :The Led gnomes can be used as a light at night ,which will make your home more attractive and bring you happiness and warmth .They need to be installed two AAA batteries(not provide) to make them light up. High Quality Material:Our handmade Gnomes are made of high quality material which is durable reusable,harmless and non-toxic,you can rest assured that your family can use them for home decoration . Good Service:If you are not 100% satisfied with our products, please contact us at anytime,we will handle it for you within 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KvmvlVLRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Attiigny","source_asin":"B0B4DBPSBY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1013243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4DBPSBY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4DBPSBY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1013244,"name":"ZNQ Strong Wind, Low Noise, 360˚ Cooling Neck Fan, Wearable Air Conditioner, 3 Speed Portable Neck Fan with 4 Turbo Motors, Auto On-Off Mode, 4000mAh ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dopQkxoDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2021 - ZENONIQ PORTABLE NECK FAN The latest and the third generation for 2021 model has two awesome colors options a deep blue and a pink The fan does not have any blades, so women will not have to worry about getting their hair tangled It has a 4000 milliamp battery that lasts upto 5 to 6 hours of continuous use, and of course, this depends on the level or speed you have the fan running on. It has a mild, a medium, a strong and a unique gust mode which is the natural wind flow mode with an auto on and off wind every few seconds. It is useful if you don t really like a constant wind flow. Honestly, The run time is of about 3 hours minimum which is really good! On the right side of the fan is the power button, Press it once, it powers on in the mild wind speed and you can hear for yourself it doesn't really make that much sound, you can barely hear the wind come out, very quiet and gentle. Press it the second time to change the fan wind speed to medium And then a third time to change the wind speed to the strongest level. It's perfect to use either indoors or outdoors e.g in the house, office, car, gym, riding bikes, trekking, climbing, picnicking or whatever you want. It is more ergonomic, comfortable, easy to use Our Verdict: A perfect portable neck fan with a good all-round performance and it is also a definite head turner! FIRST USE: Please charge the fan for at least overnight before the first time use GENERAL CAUTION: Avoid using any electronic products (that include rechargeable batteries) when plugged in for charging Do not allow children under 6 years to use this or similar products alone or unsupervised","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dopQkxoDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZNQ","source_asin":"B093T72XM3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1013244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093T72XM3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093T72XM3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
