window.products.push({"id":1013381,"name":"MexHandcraft Clear Blown 8 oz DOF Rocks Glasses, set of 6, Mexican Handmade Glassware, Recycled Glass, Lead & Toxin Free (DOF Rocks)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MJMGMZETL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RUSTIC SIMPLICITY - Our Clear Blown Glasses are individually handcrafted from recycled glass, making each of them unique works of art. Inspired by wabi sabi philosophy, they have a rustic, imperfect feel to them. You will find they are amazing day-to-day glasses that will also look great in your cupboard. Available in many sizes and styles, only from MexHandcraft. CRAFTED BY SKILLED ARTISANS - These works of art were handcrafted one by one by expert glass-blowing artisans in the town of Tonala, Mexico, where families have perfected their craft for centuries. As such, each glass is unique with slight variations from the rest. No two are exactly the same! PERFECT SIZE - They have a comfort drinking size of 8 oz. With a 3.1\" diameter and 3.1\" in height, these glasses will feel just right in your hands. GOOD FOR YOU & OUR PLANET - All our products are 100% lead-free & toxin-free, manufactured out of recycled soda bottles. They come packed with recycled cardboard and water-dissolvable packing peanuts. The recycled glass used in their production gives them a slight tint mostly noticeable in the base of the glass. 1-YEAR WARRANTY - Hassle-free replacement for any defects or breakages during transit for up to 1 year. Just contact MexHandcraftDOTcom and we'll make it right!! All our glasses are dishwasher safe, but we recommend to put them in the top rack and allow a cooling off period before using. Do not put in microwave or use to serve hot drinks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MJMGMZETL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MexHandcraft","source_asin":"B0B5Y6CTVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1013381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5Y6CTVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5Y6CTVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1013382,"name":"JÁCLER Queen Size 3 Piece Duvet Cover Set - Duvet Cover with 2 Pillow Shams -Extra Soft -Easy Fit -Breathable, Wrinkle Free, Fade, Stain Resistant, - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fJG-u7q5L._AC_.jpg","description":"Your New Favorite Duvet Covers Do you want a beautiful duvet cover that is easy to put on and easy to take off? The JÁCLER duvet comforter set is luxuriously soft and easy to sleep in all year round. We have discovered the perfect mix between lightweight bedding and cutting-edge materials that allow you to use the same duvet cover in both the summer months and winter months. Each duvet comforter comes with 2 matching pillow shams to help you create a beautiful bedspread. Soft and Breathable Each gorgeous modern color option is made from the same luxury quality double brushed microfiber fabric. The fabric feels amazing on your skin and has excellent airflow for increased breathability and proper insulation no matter the season. Our affordable pricing is perfect for families, guest rooms, dorm rooms or kid bedrooms. The duvet and pillow sham fabric is hypoallergenic to help your family keep away from allergens and skin sensitivities. This is also perfect for people who want to add extra warmth in the winter and add extra moisture wicking breathability in the summer. Easy to Use One person can easily and quickly remove or add their duvet cover to their favorite comforter insert. Each duvet has a zipper to lock into any style comforter, quilt, or thick bedding cover. This product is machine wash safe and can be air dried or tumble dry low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fJG-u7q5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JÁCLER","source_asin":"B08BTKVG5N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1013382","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BTKVG5N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BTKVG5N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
