window.products.push({"id":1013442,"name":"Nuwave Brio 4.5-Qt Air Fryer, 1 Touch Digital Controls, 100°-400°F Temp Controls in 5° Increments, Linear Thermal (Linear T) Technology, 3 Wattage Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":111.05,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WAQ1rwp-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAKE ADJUSTMENTS ON-THE-FLY – Want hotter temperature or need to cook it longer? No problem. Simply adjust on-the-fly any time. Control time and temperature any time in the cooking process. Brio’s intuitive digital controls are easy to operate. DIGITAL CONTROLS - Set cook temperatures from 100°F to 400°F adjustable in precise 5°F increments. Unlike the primitive methods that regulate temperature by turning the heater on and off, our heater never turns off while cooking. HEALTHY FRIED FOOD - Brio uses super-heated air and an efficient air-flow design to cook crispy delicious fried foods without the guilt. Brio allows you to air fry all your favorites - even from frozen, without defrosting. PERFECT SIZE – Whether cooking for one or a family, 4.5 Qt is the perfect companion. Air fry, broil, roast, grill, bake, reheat and even dehydrate - all in one appliance right on your countertop. LINEAR THERMAL (LINEAR T) TECHNOLOGY – Linear T executes the set temperature accurately throughout the entire cooking process by continuously monitoring temperature fluctuations and making constant power adjustments every second to maintain the set temperature to ensure perfect results. PERFECT FOR DORMS AND RV’S – Brio is designed to work well when the power source is less than ideal. It performs flawlessly in RV’s, dorm rooms, cabins, and campsites. With its 3 wattage settings of 600, 900 and 1300 watts, you can cook anywhere, anytime with limited power. SAFETY BUILT-IN - When the air fry basket is pulled out (opened), cooking is paused for safety. Once the basket is pushed back in (closed), the cooking resumes automatically. DESIGN & ENGINEERING –Every feature and function of Brio are created and rigorously tested by highly trained chefs and RD team. We obsessed over every detail in pursuit of best taste and performance. Brio is engineered to out-perform your expectations. EASY CLEANUP - Air fry basket is non-stick, and the liner is never-rust stainless steel. All are dishwasher safe, and the cleanup is a breeze. WHAT’S INCLUDED - The 4.5 Qt Brio comes with the all-metal basket and cooking chamber, recipe book, NUWAVE cooking club app, and 1-year manufacture’s limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WAQ1rwp-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuwave","source_asin":"B082YKDQWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1013442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082YKDQWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082YKDQWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
