window.products.push({"id":1013786,"name":"PackIt Freezable Carryall Lunch Bag, Gingham","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ko1Jtf1SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Travel in style with this convenient reusable lunch bag. PackIt's Freezable Carryall Lunch Bag features PackIt's patented cooling technology that keeps contents cool for hours. Freezable gel is built into the walls of the bag, so no additional ice or gel packs are needed. To use, simply collapse the Carryall bag flat and place in your freezer overnight (12 hours for optimal results). In the morning, the bag will be fully frozen and ready to use! PackIt keeps food cooler for hours, which allows you to pack healthy foods such as yogurt, milk, fruits and veggies. The cooling power even lasts long enough to bring home leftovers, which reduces waste and saves you money. The Carryall Lunch Bag features a big, bold design and fits a large meal or salad, a snack, and 12-ounce drink. An exterior storage pouch holds utensils and supplies and a comfortable carrying strap leaves your hands free. The reinforced zip closure on this lunch bag secures food inside and locks in cool, dry air. The Carryall Lunchbag is made from nontoxic poly canvas and has a food safe water-resistant lining. Like all PackIt products, the Carryall is made from PVC-, BPA-, phthalate-, formaldehyde- and lead-free materials. To clean, wipe thoroughly or hand wash the interior and spot clean exterior; allow bag to dry completely before freezing. Not machine or dishwasher safe. When open, the Carryall bag measures 9 inches tall, 13 inches wide and 6 inches deep. When flattened, it measures 9 inches deep, 13.75 inches wide, and 2 inches tall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ko1Jtf1SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PackIt","source_asin":"B00SJRLR7Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1013786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00SJRLR7Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00SJRLR7Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1013787,"name":"Breaking Bad Let's cook cutting board. Breaking Bad, Heisenberg, custom engraved cutting board featuring\"Let's Cook\". Walter White cutting board (9.8 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A10KNLhqhYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Breaking Bad Let's cook cutting board. Breaking Bad, Heisenberg, custom engraved cutting board featuring \"Let's Cook\". Walter White Personalized Engraved Cutting Board, Custom cutting board - Wedding Gift, Anniversary Gifts, Housewarming Gift,Birthday Gift, Corporate Gift, Award, Promotion. ◆ AN IDEAL GIFT FOR ANY OCCASION ◆  Personalized cutting board is Perfect for any occasion: Birthday, Anniversary, Wedding, Bridal Shower, Mother's Day, Father’s Day, Christmas or Housewarming gift for any family, couple etc. This cutting board is the ideal gift choice for your loved ones. It is guaranteed to be a talking point wherever it is presented.  ◆ UNIQUE DESIGN ◆ Very detailed laser engraving of Walter White and Jesse Pinkman. Each face is made of small words and letters. ◆ BEST QUALITY ◆   This cutting is made of Premium Oak Wood (not cheap Bamboo that most sellers offer) and covered twice with hot mineral oil to last long! Each board is unique since it has a unique tree structure. ◆ SIZE 8” x 12” ◆  - These are not big heavy duty thick chopping blocks, these are more for serving or display. Mom will most likely treasure this one as a kitchen decor keepsake gift from son or gift idea from daughter. But still it can be used for food prep on the solid side. ◆ Additional Care Tips ◆  * Clean in hot, soapy water and wipe with a rag. Natural wood should NOT be cleaned using the dishwasher.  * While Oak is an enduring wood, we suggest oiling your boards every few months. Use food safe products such as linseed oil, re-fractionated coconut oil, or beeswax. Apply to the board liberally and wipe off excess. Allow board to set overnight before use.  ◆ 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED ◆  Contact us and let us know if you have any questions or concerns - Your satisfaction is our TOP priority!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A10KNLhqhYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TheHrdwood","source_asin":"B0731GLJ1J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1013787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0731GLJ1J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0731GLJ1J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
