window.products.push({"id":1013827,"name":"Z Wraps - Reusable Beeswax Food Wraps - Assorted 3-Pack (1 Sm, 2 Med) - Made in USA with 100-Precent Cotton, Organic Beeswax and Jojoba Oil - (Bees, P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HXCI3GmzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Z Wraps are Made in the USA with 100-Percent Cotton, Organic Beeswax and Jojoba Oil. These are Beautiful, Innovative, Natural and Reusable alternatives to plastic and other synthetic food wraps. Z Wraps are reusable beeswax food wraps that keep food fresh and help the planet at the same time. With two sizes and two fun designs, these food wraps are perfect for everything from storing leftovers to packing lunches and snacks for the road. Each 3-pack set comes with three wraps - one small (8 x 8-inch), two medium (12 x 12-inch). Wrap cheese, half an avocado, lemon, a sandwich or leftover veggies. Z Wraps are soft, pliable, and simple to use. One Z Wrap can be washed and reused more than 100 times. Made in the USA with responsible materials and packaging. Both the Z Wraps (and their packaging) are Compostable. Z Wraps are easy to wrap - the self adhesive nature of our Z Wraps will create a seal around any foodstuff you are hoping to wrap and seal. Z Wraps are also ideal to cover and seal when storing food in bowls or storage containers, when in the refrigerator or lunchboxes and more. Warming the wrap in your hands can help to improve adhesive properties. Handwash Z Wraps under cool water with mild soap and leave to air dry. Do not microwave. And avoid excessive heat, as it can melt the wax Small Wraps are great for lemons, avocados, tomatoes, cucumbers, onions and more. Medium Wraps are great for a sandwich, a block of hard cheese or some leftover greens or herbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HXCI3GmzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Z Wraps","source_asin":"B08DCRJC2F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1013827","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DCRJC2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DCRJC2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
