window.products.push({"id":1013947,"name":"SWISSARABIAN Indian Oud Wood (Agarwood), Natural Aloeswood Oudh Chips for use with Charcoal or Electric Incense Burner 1 Tola from The House of Swiss ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bMV7XO6tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Indian Oud Wood or agarwood chips have been famous since time immemorial when they made their way to far off kingdoms in west Asia and Africa through deeply intertwined spice route and incense route. Now Swiss Arabian extends that route from far East and makes way for the Indian oud chips to far West. Relive through history again, the experience so priceless. Indian Oud Wood has a very complex fusion of rich aroma of spices and pungent notes with hidden delicate whiffs of sweet floral notes. With deeper burning of the wood, the aroma is heavy woody, smooth just like smoke rising up in a still room which is very soulful leaving you in a deep pensive mood. Swiss Arabian's agarwood chips contains 100% Indian natural agarwood chips and packaged with great care and attention to detail to create the amazing scent that is unforgettable and extremmerly fantastic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bMV7XO6tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swiss Arabian","source_asin":"B07TBG9NXD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1013947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TBG9NXD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TBG9NXD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
